  "releaseNotes": "Adds protocol-aware ASP.NET Core TOON formatting.\n- Adds X-Toon-Version body metadata and independent response-version selection\n- Adds pre-body validation with precise malformed, unsupported, and conflicting-version responses\n- Breaking: defaults responses to official 4.4 with lossless omission settings and two-space indentation\n- Fixes excessive response indentation by accepting HTTP override widths from 1 through 16\n- Improves request option reuse while revalidating changed override headers\n- Updates the runtime dependency to DevOp.Toon 0.3.0",
